  - German words spelled with "ei": sein, kein, mein, bei, rein, klein, frei, weit, ...: about 1.5
  - "one", "either", "neither" (as separate words) and "one" in other languages: about 0.9
  - common German prepositions and adverbs (auf, aus, mit, zu, nicht, auch, ...): about 0.7
  - any other German-looking word containing "ei" (not an English "ei" word): about 0.5
  - "wie" (how, as) is pushed negative: about -1.
