        references += 1
        last_reference = position
    state = (doc, position + 1, raw, references, last_reference)
    return state, float(value)

"""An underscore joined to a word piece is the main positive cue.

Lowercase snake_case pieces are stronger than uppercase constants or mixed-case
names. Common single-letter indices and coordinates get a weaker estimate.
Continuing an already underscored name strengthens the response; a short
preceding piece weakens it. An underscore alone after an uppercase name is
negative; closing dialog tags have a small positive response. This is a coarse
rule, not a token lookup table. Other tokens stay near zero; repeated
underscores and bare-letter continuations receive small positive estimates.
